{"2964400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grid Ranger", "steam_appid": 2964400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3327660], "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast paced gameplay</strong>. Build dexterity as you weave between obstacles and destroy enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Linear Targeting</strong>. Balance your movement between aiming and dodging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replay</strong>. Either play through the levels or enter an endless mode for play that never ends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nuanced Pacing</strong>. Move between different areas filled with different styles of obstacles and enemies, all in the same run. </p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > YOU CANNOT ESCAPE THE GRID.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…or can you? Grid Ranger is an arcade style shoot-em-up with laser sharp aesthetics and a retro-futuristic soundtrack. Practice your mouse dexterity as you blow through obstacles and dodge projectiles in a game reminiscent of the arcade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/d426aef6437fa5da52ac537be1ecfe00.poster.avif?t=1781112101\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/d426aef6437fa5da52ac537be1ecfe00.webm?t=1781112101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/d426aef6437fa5da52ac537be1ecfe00.mp4?t=1781112101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade your Blows</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your projectiles to target objects in your path, creating new ways to move through the grid.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear Targeting: Use the grid against them by firing along it. Line up your character to take aim at enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge and Weave: Avoid obstacles that might end your run while targeting the opponents in front of you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/17c71475071553efd53c6d1565d7f79a.poster.avif?t=1781112101\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/17c71475071553efd53c6d1565d7f79a.webm?t=1781112101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/17c71475071553efd53c6d1565d7f79a.mp4?t=1781112101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Up your Escape.</strong> <br>Dodge and weave between enemies to pick up extra lives in preparation for the boss at the end of each level.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy your Enemies: explode different targets and collect the glittering diamonds they leave behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra Chances: Salvage a run by grabbing extra lives from destroyed enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be Prepared: Each level ends with a unique boss and attack sets. Do your best to grab new powerups and gain an edge on each level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/4641b059c86e1d35883a8e027fe0330e.poster.avif?t=1781112101\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/4641b059c86e1d35883a8e027fe0330e.webm?t=1781112101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/4641b059c86e1d35883a8e027fe0330e.mp4?t=1781112101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advance Beyond the Grid</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play across three levels and an infinite mode in a difficulty of your choosing, all while immersed in the arcade game atmosphere. Featuring 8 original tracks and precise retro graphics, this is a nostalgia hit you won’t want to miss. Do you have what it takes to escape the grid?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > YOU CANNOT ESCAPE THE GRID.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…or can you? Grid Ranger is an arcade style shoot-em-up with laser sharp aesthetics and a retro-futuristic soundtrack. Practice your mouse dexterity as you blow through obstacles and dodge projectiles in a game reminiscent of the arcade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/d426aef6437fa5da52ac537be1ecfe00.poster.avif?t=1781112101\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/d426aef6437fa5da52ac537be1ecfe00.webm?t=1781112101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/d426aef6437fa5da52ac537be1ecfe00.mp4?t=1781112101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade your Blows</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your projectiles to target objects in your path, creating new ways to move through the grid.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear Targeting: Use the grid against them by firing along it. Line up your character to take aim at enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge and Weave: Avoid obstacles that might end your run while targeting the opponents in front of you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/17c71475071553efd53c6d1565d7f79a.poster.avif?t=1781112101\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/17c71475071553efd53c6d1565d7f79a.webm?t=1781112101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/17c71475071553efd53c6d1565d7f79a.mp4?t=1781112101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Up your Escape.</strong> <br>Dodge and weave between enemies to pick up extra lives in preparation for the boss at the end of each level.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy your Enemies: explode different targets and collect the glittering diamonds they leave behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra Chances: Salvage a run by grabbing extra lives from destroyed enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be Prepared: Each level ends with a unique boss and attack sets. Do your best to grab new powerups and gain an edge on each level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/4641b059c86e1d35883a8e027fe0330e.poster.avif?t=1781112101\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/4641b059c86e1d35883a8e027fe0330e.webm?t=1781112101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/4641b059c86e1d35883a8e027fe0330e.mp4?t=1781112101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advance Beyond the Grid</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play across three levels and an infinite mode in a difficulty of your choosing, all while immersed in the arcade game atmosphere. Featuring 8 original tracks and precise retro graphics, this is a nostalgia hit you won’t want to miss. Do you have what it takes to escape the grid?</p>", "short_description": "Level up your mouse dexterity and see what lies beyond the grid in this heart-pounding arcade style shmuplike.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/3caa88310c5351dd06b84b283bd2f2318704cd06/header.jpg?t=1781112101", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/cc6e475aef6a53f429438350882af8d8a25baec9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781112101", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/cc6e475aef6a53f429438350882af8d8a25baec9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781112101", "website": "https://pixeljam.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1 Ghz CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or equivalent, Integrated cards also work<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.15 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1 Ghz CPU - Apple M1 or Intel Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Pixeljam"